  "release_notes": "A more compact window that fits smaller and lower-resolution screens.\n\n- The window is about a third shorter and sizes itself to fit your screen, while always showing the newest Ready plus at least three older messages.\n- The Ready button now sits beside Ready Messages and grows and shrinks with the window. After a send it briefly turns green and shows who you sent to.\n- One-line header: \"This station: ... Edit\" now sits next to the stations-online indicator.\n- Alert sound and volume are on one line, with the Send to stations below them.\n- Times are right-aligned next to each Ready message.",
